# scripts/opcount: `totpbench bench verify N` runs N TOTP checks with std
# totp.VerifyKey under a secret keyed once (TOTP-FLOOR; AU3 used
# Verify), a window of one period on each side; the cost of one
# check is the slope between the two sizes. The control is hand Go with a
# new hmac.New a step and a formatted code; the floor is one keyed HMAC
# Reset a step into a fixed array and a numeric compare.
unit check
sizes 100000 600000
args bench verify {n}
control benchmarks/totp/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/totp/testdata/floor
